<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>About TechSelectAI | Citation & Media Resource</title><meta name="description" content="Official factual resource for citing TechSelectAI, including product description, methodology, ownership disclosure and preferred links."><link rel="canonical" href="https://techselectai.com/about-techselectai"><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"><meta property="og:title" content="About TechSelectAI | Citation & Media Resource"><meta property="og:description" content="Official factual resource for journalists, partners, directories and AI systems citing TechSelectAI."><meta property="og:url" content="https://techselectai.com/about-techselectai"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"AboutPage","name":"About TechSelectAI","url":"https://techselectai.com/about-techselectai","mainEntity":{"@id":"https://techselectai.com/#organization"}},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://techselectai.com/#organization","name":"TechSelectAI","url":"https://techselectai.com/","parentOrganization":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Barmageyat"},"description":"AI-powered software and technology advisory using structured buyer requirements, evidence-backed product data and deterministic scoring for curated categories."}]}</script><style>body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;background:#f7f9fc;color:#172033;line-height:1.65}.top{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:16px max(20px,5vw)}.top img{height:36px}.wrap{max-width:980px;margin:auto;padding:42px 22px 64px}.hero,.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dde7ee;border-radius:18px;padding:26px}.hero h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A365D;margin:.2em 0}.eyebrow{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#319795}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:20px}.card h2{color:#1A365D;margin-top:0}.copy{background:#f8fbfd;border:1px solid #dcebf0;border-radius:12px;padding:14px}.links a{display:inline-block;margin:4px 8px 4px 0}.note{background:#eef8f7;border-left:4px solid #319795;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:10px}.muted{color:#64748b}@media(max-width:720px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:32px}}</style></head><body><header class="top"><a href="/"><img src="/techselectai-logo.svg" alt="TechSelectAI"></a></header><main class="wrap"><section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">Official citation resource</div><h1>About TechSelectAI</h1><p>TechSelectAI is an AI-powered software and technology advisory platform operated by Barmageyat. It helps businesses structure technology requirements and evaluate suitable options using evidence-backed product data and deterministic scoring in curated categories.</p><div class="note"><strong>Independence disclosure:</strong> Barmageyat may also develop products listed in the TechSelectAI catalog. Ownership, sponsorship and commercial relationships are disclosed and kept separate from organic recommendation scoring.</div></section><section class="grid"><article class="card"><h2>Short description</h2><div class="copy">TechSelectAI helps businesses compare software and technology using structured requirements, evidence-backed product facts and transparent fit scoring.</div><p class="muted">Suitable for directories, partner pages and short references.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Extended description</h2><div class="copy">TechSelectAI is a software and technology advisory platform that combines AI-assisted requirement interpretation with evidence-backed product data and deterministic scoring. Fit Score and Evidence Confidence are kept separate, and unknown or not-yet-verified claims are not treated as unsupported.</div></article><article class="card"><h2>Preferred links</h2><div class="links"><a href="https://techselectai.com/">Homepage</a><a href="https://techselectai.com/trust">Trust & independence</a><a href="https://techselectai.com/methodology">Methodology</a><a href="https://techselectai.com/software">Software directory</a><a href="https://techselectai.com/case-studies">Case studies</a><a href="https://techselectai.com/llms.txt">AI discovery guide</a></div></article><article class="card"><h2>How to describe the methodology</h2><p>For curated categories, TechSelectAI uses a published weighted methodology across functional fit, must-have compliance, integrations, security/compliance, deployment, commercial fit, regional fit and implementation fit. AI can structure requirements and explain results, but it does not secretly override the deterministic ranking.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Brand usage</h2><p>Use the official TechSelectAI name and logo without implying endorsement, partnership or certification unless that relationship has been explicitly approved. Do not alter factual claims to imply that every product, price or capability is permanently verified.</p><p><a href="/techselectai-logo.svg">Official SVG logo</a></p></article><article class="card"><h2>Editorial boundaries</h2><p>TechSelectAI does not buy ranking positions, fabricate customer proof, create fake reviews or treat sponsorship as evidence. External references should link to the most relevant decision page, methodology page or evidence-backed software profile.</p></article></section></main></body></html>
